{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "9b0e78df14db4d8a0ab24e1b046bb3dd6d1bf6c80d11936a5d446ed06491272c", "ja": "共闘！　そういうのもあるのか", "zh": "联手战斗！还有这种展开吗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a7a4c26c739ea9c79983ecf70ad3c34c9e6d52c88a1eafc0ca6fc4b9218dd4dd", "ja": "CD販売イベントがスタート！出だしは熱心な\nファンが来てくれたものの、時間帯もあって\n客足が落ち着いてしまう。奈緒と雪歩は客を\n呼び込むため、一時協力体制に。昴と瑞希も\n共同戦線を張る中、奈緒と昴の兄が訪れる。", "zh": "CD发售活动开始了！虽然一开始有热情的\n粉丝前来捧场，但受时间段的影响，\n客流逐渐平稳下来。为了招揽客人，\n奈绪和雪步暂时联手。昴和瑞希也\n结成了共同战线，这时奈绪和昴的哥哥来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82ea7a7489aeeb259a3dd9fa557ebff8296ba7f4ffff2ad8dd7293704f468b08", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』が、いよいよ開幕！\n初回は、新曲CDの販売数を競う勝負だ）", "zh": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』终于开幕了！\n第一场比赛，是比拼新曲CD的销量。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e7d0460257dbd15123ca70ee2c560d45680fc051b15edbd7f37b0dfd11a43e9e", "ja": "（今頃会場では、火花が散っているはず……\n打ち合わせが終わったら、急いで現場に向かおう！）", "zh": "（会场现在应该正火花四溅吧……等商谈结束后，赶紧去现场！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "594f355cecec32de16b9a2158c781921ef9202ebea113a8b694b47cea0497865", "ja": "うーん。なんか、イマイチやなぁ……。\n平日の昼間やし、こんなもんなんやろか？", "zh": "嗯……总觉得差点意思啊……\n毕竟是工作日的白天，难道也就这样了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1ef72a33a46a0540a779342f5a55a88f694fcfaac369e9174863a814a368466d", "ja": "出だしは、熱心なファンの人たちが\nたくさん並んでくれたんだけどね……。", "zh": "不过一开始，有很多热情的粉丝排队来支持我们呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "fcb68124008baa304d4d98302fca2a9ca91e362b9e8385f112c2adec6c15c580", "ja": "いったん波が引いてまうと、厳しいなぁ。\n人が集まってへんと、流し見もしづらいやろうし……。", "zh": "人潮一旦退去，就难办了啊。\n要是不聚起些人的话，路过的人也很难顺便看一眼吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e1ed9f7b0616471faf423504a9c7d2b89ce78c1ff4b11966546b2232ef759f0a", "ja": "そろそろ夕方だし、学生さんとか会社帰りの\n人とか増えてくるとは思うんだけど……。", "zh": "差不多到傍晚了，我想学生和下班回家的人应该会渐渐多起来，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "ebc6fe58292d5a62dd504fba8bd5334e930d8d7064ab211fa014c1d23348aacc", "ja": "せやな。ご新規さんの興味を引けるかどうか……\nなぁ雪歩、提案があるんやけど。", "zh": "是啊。能不能吸引新客人的兴趣……\n雪步，我有个提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d5f2e64064e5e301b0af36aaa91eabc9c1a01c28e9cd71d46a0f158595fdb9a7", "ja": "？\nなぁに、奈緒ちゃん？", "zh": "？\n怎么了，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "172d59e5f492065d447b9cefc1ac65ac8302e199a1a19e760707a5f810123613", "ja": "声出しは、絶対に人数いた方が強いやんな。\nそこで！　私と一時的に、協力関係、組まへん？", "zh": "练声的话，人多绝对更有优势吧。\n所以！要不要暂时跟我组个合作关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1637766fe3cf75e882f7f50c38a356923afb0f4f1e82a75ad1967c721c126178", "ja": "え！？　でも、今回は全員が\nライバルっていう話じゃ……。", "zh": "诶！？可是，这次不是说所有人都是竞争对手吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "b5b32524cc799d71f881b92cc11bea2311df9e2c92ffd76d194a858ed1ddae80", "ja": "せやけど、総合優勝はPrincess、Fairy、\nAngelのグループで決まるって言うてたやろ？", "zh": "可是，你不是说过，总冠军要在Princess、Fairy、Angel这三个组里决出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "233dcde543cabadf8864b013f9c08a375ad6e2780e671d23c586ef306a48384f", "ja": "つまり私らが協力すれば、\nPrincessの勝ちは決まりや！", "zh": "也就是说，只要我们合作，Princess就赢定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d4353a6800d78aadd327ce71900151e2f6dd7f1c1e0374d267e5fa309ea21f4c", "ja": "た、たしかに、そうかも……！", "zh": "确、确实，也许是这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "47b41f3ddc3b56fe89d15bfaf030fdb0a6c53ad40e4ebaa22a88fb7b15660d8c", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "你们两个，辛苦了。\n状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "0f0c0eaba08e439c02768f32ff286cb0d2950305fdcf0a505ff0ffda42102bdc", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nちょうどいいとこに！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "3ffcbd02e731773098f63156bd700944667e3915e0ae7525717280d3b68f17cc", "ja": "今回のCDの手売りなんですけど、私と雪歩で、\n一時的に協力するっていうのはダメですか？", "zh": "这次CD的现场售卖，我和雪步暂时合作一下，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "a68dfa4d81b65d2980aab0d78e6d3120de586d4f967d0d3570b28e3c19b60740", "ja": "雪歩と私は、同じPRINCESS STARSやし。\nなっ♪", "zh": "雪步和我都是PRINCESS STARS嘛。对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "00bde801cbe114d3bb5fd228c8a023b3a47864b7cb1edba6daeb98d7b96f0eb9", "ja": "う、うん！　奈緒ちゃんと一緒なら私も、\nもっと思いきって声が掛けられるかも……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！如果和奈绪酱一起的话，我或许也能更大胆地搭话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0e0fa3b9bf01c7b4fdc604cde90359c02f77155373e78c26e4e32d8806890062", "ja": "Princess同士での共闘か。\nうん、総合優勝を狙うなら、ありなんじゃないか？", "zh": "同为Princess之间的联手作战吗。\n嗯，既然目标是综合优胜，那未尝不可吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "10e60b8028511f4478343b889c7b0fcbed888a7b4dd8532d91ab81317f5bbbea", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございますぅ！\nがんばります！", "zh": "啊，非常感谢您！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "ddb2f07162593917dc28463fadb80fbf353b524686cee4fdaee5d49480790e9e", "ja": "決まりやな！　さあ、よってらっしゃい\nみてらっしゃい！　CDいかがですか～！", "zh": "就这么定了！来来来，过来看看吧！\n刚出的新CD，要不要买一张～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "94747a60e45da4ef862181893cffc179885fafbeb3ab9d9ba6565c23315567cf", "ja": "ぜ、ぜひ見ていってください！\n出たばっかりの新譜ですぅ！", "zh": "请、请务必来看看！\n这是刚刚发行的新专辑～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1022_unknown2", "source_sha256": "757a24c5b042a1895b766c1e8b0e1dc00c81ffb3e6ab95188095e5157e02e49a", "ja": "出たばっかりの新譜ねえ……。\nなら、新鮮なとこもらおうか！", "zh": "刚发行的新专辑啊……那就来点新鲜的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f020af8c998cc518a17be8802f76133ec15ec53f3fb44976926b20d8aa02cd43", "ja": "ひっ！？　さっそく男の人が……あ、あれ？\nでも、どこかで見たことがあるような……？", "zh": "咦！？这么快就有男人来了……啊，咦？\n不过，总觉得好像在哪里见过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3da61e11627ff71e20ba44b71dab5f8b78cd6aec245757efb1511823f7fece90", "ja": "ん？　……ああ！\n雪歩、この人は奈緒の……。", "zh": "嗯？……啊啊！雪步，这位是奈绪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "22988c35cf4fb64de55da900b5f8e37a365c46f3e4c3bbede11ceab6637137da", "ja": "あっ！　さ、サッカーの、横山慧（けい）選手……\n奈緒ちゃんの、お兄さんの……！", "zh": "啊！足、足球运动员横山慧选手……\n奈绪的、哥哥……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "b1e4cce45d2b614689c37890b39f5b1ba7964378932afece3421ba8b263e63b5", "ja": "あ、アニキ！？　アニキが\nこんなイベント来るなんて、珍し……。", "zh": "啊，大、大哥！？大哥居然会来\n这种活动，真少见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1027_kei", "source_sha256": "90c0c8c44bfc94d9df00a4c984cafa3fba22ca700268ceeef88bb13c3cdeabcc", "ja": "休みだから、様子見に来たんだよ。\nほら、チームメイト連れてきてやったぞ。", "zh": "因为今天休息，所以过来看看你。\n喏，我还把队友们带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "2b747fe5bdfc6dd82642ac917e152ccfbcb167e802053207c81966f900656db2", "ja": "ほんまに！？\nアニキにしては気ぃ利くやん♪", "zh": "真的！？\n没想到老哥你还挺会照顾人的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1029_aninotimumeitoa", "source_sha256": "56906b679e1799fee37ff09326d0b70eacab8998abf13fdf55f2349a1697d25d", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん、久しぶり！\nCD買いに来よったで～。", "zh": "小奈绪，好久不见！\n我来买CD啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1030_aninotimumeitob", "source_sha256": "09aaa76a02296cff5e77699e2c0b7ade0e75a3455bc923e19fcbe3009ab744b5", "ja": "おお～、本当にCD手売りしてる！\nアイドルって感じ……。", "zh": "哦～真的在亲手卖CD！\n这才有偶像的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "1bd90c432082483ab92db1b6cb057d1a52c1e72dda80a9696ebde8eab121e815", "ja": "ほんまもんのアイドルやからな♪\nみんな、ようけ買うてくれるんやろ？", "zh": "因为是真正的偶像嘛♪\n大家都会买很多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1032_kei", "source_sha256": "426f7f0ad4ddb16eb882c78d596a7bfe3ac3cff8f16836a69c3979b8f58839f7", "ja": "アホか、ひとり1枚でええわ。それに自分、\nそんなお情けで勝負に勝って、満足なのか？", "zh": "傻吗，一个人1张就够了。再说，你靠这种施舍赢了比赛，真的会满足吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d70f59d8adbcc15f21e8a237c88acc4514d65a8dc21c6b7b3a3c6cd5ab5d708", "ja": "ぐっ……！\n身内からの正論って腹立つわぁ……。", "zh": "呃……！\n自己人说的实话真让人火大啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "079579821f396c122196b827616e52f27ea1b9040bf6b9be9d72921a493a3cc5", "ja": "なあなあ、{$P$}！\nこっちにも来てよー！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！\n也到我这边来嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e4cc3475978125ad79efe3f335684e82cbf2821ce781df5f13e7e70b6d3c19d3", "ja": "ああ、今行くよ！", "zh": "啊啊，这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "f566476c86237228e82c9d4606873619016997e3bcaa32ecdd3a481399021e3b", "ja": "奈緒と雪歩の話聞こえたけど、\n協力するのアリってホント？", "zh": "我听到奈绪和雪步的谈话了，\n真的可以合作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "daf577f9fecedfdc5cfca947f745ebb19bcfa6f37bc286a07598ebaa93a1ef43", "ja": "もちろん、問題ないよ。\n最終的には、チームごとの勝敗だけどな。", "zh": "当然没问题啊。\n虽然最终还是要看各队的胜负就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1038_047sub", "source_sha256": "015244c6fa4397deafe25b9402715e7b4f518dad37ed4489bb782a8ab3eb8599", "ja": "わかった！\nそれなら瑞希、こっちも協力しようぜ！", "zh": "明白了！\n既然这样瑞希，我们也来合作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "8d15aa144f08175f5e7f5ec5b9650402040c9bcb67660e9c3ad9c341557eaea8", "ja": "はい。FAIRY STARSで\n共同戦線といきましょう。", "zh": "好的。那就让FAIRY STARS一起并肩作战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "356948a82936e775756a2bde571992720abf79878370b75a04bc6b21aafffd2a", "ja": "よーし、それじゃ……\nすぅー……。", "zh": "好，那就……  \n吸——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "e4bdf661202ec3d8ff03626728aa3c202675ad79bcbf5140016fab9faf405bbd", "ja": "みんなー、CD買ってってくれよー！\nオレたちの新曲、出来立てホヤホヤだぜー！", "zh": "大家——买张CD吧——！\n我们的新歌可是刚出炉的热乎货哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "331aa8ce4a8d4c91332704c4c68dbd5502c1f3536e22638213a9f3e0d6222ca5", "ja": "ぜひ、お手に取ってください。\n……今なら手品のおまけつき、だぞ。", "zh": "请务必拿一张吧。  \n……现在购买的话，还附赠魔术表演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1043_unknown2", "source_sha256": "31694e23d20acebd7d350186a682faf968ec0e5483eb3bfdd696e6bdc5edd837", "ja": "お、やってるやってる。\nおーい、昴！", "zh": "哦，在做呢在做呢。\n喂，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "22b03ab3bacd64fbf341e0bfba0f7458241b1aa4b83cf9c1dd372085ab6a7053", "ja": "ん？　……あれっ！？\n将人（まさと）兄ちゃんに、大輝（たいき）兄ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯？……咦！？\n将人哥哥，还有大辉哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1045_taiki", "source_sha256": "618b1e519be66b5d86ffbf99bc6b2b7289a5fc3940ac4017932ff0ab51a927cb", "ja": "初日に駆け付けるなんて嫌がるかなと思ったけど、\n都合の合う日が今日しかなくてさ。", "zh": "我本来还担心第一天就赶过来会让你不高兴，不过我方便的日子只有今天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "7f069694e3fbd942f95f090ba5953098f63c2de6242aece1212dbf80a060cfe7", "ja": "全然いいって！\nCD買ってってくれるなら、いつでも大歓迎だぜ！", "zh": "完全没问题！只要你愿意买CD，随时都欢迎啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "782c302a3c1730664a74ce0e21dbfd53007d6de8e306cd2fbdf5a70ca2dee17e", "ja": "ん？　ふたりとも、どうしたんだよ。\n奈緒と雪歩を、じっと見たりしてさ。", "zh": "嗯？你们两个，怎么了？\n一直盯着奈绪和雪步看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1050_masato", "source_sha256": "82998fd248b76ccf0981ad246aeb8fc2bbf6aba4a4ba7599672de5211b6de5b4", "ja": "……。大輝、あれって横山選手、だよな……？\nプロサッカー選手の。", "zh": "……。大辉，那个是大辉选手，对吧……？\n那个职业足球选手的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1051_taiki", "source_sha256": "8150dcaac317616a851184b7a38956f6cf645268b5079c3371ab5a13833e0bd8", "ja": "やっぱそうか！\n本当に、奈緒ちゃんのお兄さんなんだな……。", "zh": "果然是这样啊！\n真的……是奈绪的哥哥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1052_taiki", "source_sha256": "9a55eb22d22261ba4e08fd6aa788a70b2ccf0c5ed6daf8ab54f17f7d013a741e", "ja": "……将人兄、あとで挨拶しに行かない？\nうちの昴がお世話になってます～、ってさ。", "zh": "……将人哥，待会儿要不要去打个招呼？\n就说“我们家昴承蒙你照顾啦～”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1053_masato", "source_sha256": "ceec23915248791e44f0d2c194def69b84d40d82720beacc19f3ea0008e56d81", "ja": "そうだな、挨拶はしておくべきだな。\nだが、ミーハーに見えないようにしないと……。", "zh": "是啊，还是应该打个招呼。\n不过，得注意别让人看起来像个追星族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "803abe5fd30cd26bbbc769be5ee312d57d8c0090c1061025c3382e577411d537", "ja": "どうやら永吉さんのお兄さんたちは、\n横山さんのお兄さんに夢中のようですね。", "zh": "看来永吉小姐的哥哥们，似乎都被横山小姐的哥哥迷住了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "f3df854887073c3c1945de09840cd4decf8425317af1034b0152b37b417228b7", "ja": "も～～～！　兄ちゃんたち！\nオレのCD買いにきてくれたんじゃないのかよ～！？", "zh": "真是的～～～！哥哥们！你们不是来买我的CD的吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0382_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_02_1056_p", "source_sha256": "141e6a35d8f419e8923e62037b504177cc66ce756ecbd829bc38bd21a930cb4b", "ja": "（初日は身内の方々多めで、賑やかになったな。\n俺も、挨拶はしっかりしておかないと……！）", "zh": "（第一天来捧场的熟人还真多，现场变得热闹起来了。我也得好好打个招呼才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
